// authorise money. enrolment_issue (0024): an officer issuing an enrolment
// code; caught by TestApiMoney01 before it shipped. member_register
// (0031): the secretary registering members. payment_resolution (0033):
// an officer proposing, confirming or rejecting a payment's resolution.
// member_email (0034): the secretary setting a member's email.
// member_status (0038): the secretary suspending, reinstating or
// recording the departure of a member. member_bank_account (0040): a
// member (or, for a member who cannot sign in, an officer) setting the
// member's bank details; bank_name_confirmation: a signatory confirming
// a bank's name for them that does not match the register.
// dispute_correction (0042): an officer proposing the correction of a
// member's queried entry; dispute_correction_decision: a second officer
// confirming or rejecting it. entry_correction (0043): an officer proposing
// a reversal or an adjustment of an entry; entry_correction_decision: a
